<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Where the game's traits set a person's character (Source/ColonyCouncil/Persona/). Each side runs from -100 to 100:
    warmth (cold to big-hearted), nerve (timid to fearless), temper (unflappable to hot-headed), humour (dour to a born
    joker), trust (suspicious to open-hearted), pride (self-effacing to vain), openness (set in their ways to restless
    for anything new), outlook (bleak to sunny). Skills, age and a small personal lean are added in code; what happens
    to a person moves them from there. A trait from a DLC or mod that isn't loaded is skipped; mods' traits can have a
    PersonaNatureDef of their own.
  -->

